WEBVTT

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:31.434
because there are hungry
children anywhere.

00:04:31.475 --> 00:04:35.229
Tell them to finish their dinner
because it’s good for the environment,

00:04:35.229 --> 00:04:36.856
and healthy food is good for them.

00:04:38.566 --> 00:04:41.902
(Applause)

00:04:41.902 --> 00:04:45.323
Second, we must ensure
that healthy food is affordable

00:04:45.364 --> 00:04:47.783
and accessible for the most vulnerable.

00:04:48.868 --> 00:04:50.745
This is a huge challenge.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:54.373
Unhealthy food kills.

00:04:54.373 --> 00:04:55.791
And we know this.

00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:59.920
One out of every five deaths
is linked to unhealthy food.

00:04:59.962 --> 00:05:02.173
And yet, one third
of our world's population